+ * recipe, bytecode and driver blob in one file, warmup-v1/race-pack-v1.bin.
+ * The loading gate opened four files a pipeline; this is one sequential read.
+ * scripts/race_preload_pack.py reads and writes the same layout.
+ *   RSX_RACE_PREWARM_PACK=0        neither read nor written (per-file opens)
+ *   RSX_RACE_PREWARM_PACK_WRITE=0  read an existing pack, never write one
+ *   RSX_RACE_PACK_KEEP=1           keep the bytes bound after use
+ * The pack is derived data: recipes, bytecode and blob files stay where they
+ * are and remain the source of truth. It is used only when its membership
+ * equals the live race index (any order, duplicate index lines ignored), its
+ * payload checksum holds and every recipe passes the per-file validation.
+ * Payload objects are 16-byte aligned; offsets are from the first payload byte. */
